  "fullText": "Publicación en el feed\n\nJenny X.\n\n \n • 3er+\n\n🏆Supply Chain Manager | Driving Operational Excellence through Data-Driven Strategies  | Expert in CPFR & Inventory Optimization | Leadership in End-to-End Solutions | Skilled in Nurturing Long-term Partnerships\n\n2 meses\n\nSeguir\n\nFeeling absolutely energized after a fantastic time at the TD SYNNEX CA and Ingram Micro CA Logi Work on Wheels this week! It was incredible to connect in-person with so many brilliant people, especially meeting our Canada L4B team and the customers I have the privilege of working with regularly. There is nothing like face-to-face interaction to strengthen partnerships. A big thank you to the organizers, Logitech Canada L4B and our customers. John Szemeczko Ryan Soares Mona Bhadauria June Pow Effie Rezkalla Luke Heaslip Debora Do Couto Matthew Tjoa Diego Tarazona #Logi Work\n\nMostrar traducción\n\n1/9\n\n47\n​\n​\n​",
